  "description": "Ready to rip through the neighborhood, run errands, or go off-road? the Skwad is the perfect bike to meet up with your crew and take it all on. With up to 40 miles of range, this is your true down-for-whatever ride. The Skwad has a retro look, but it's all modern with oversized tires that are at home on pavement and adventurous enough for shortcuts. With a comfy, cafe-style seat, Haro Baseline 9.5\" BMX handlebars and folding foot pegs, you get unmatched comfort and room for a friend. Alloy side-plates under the seat give you options to strap down your gear. Quick, safe and stable, the Skwad is your ticket to freedom. Round up your squad and get after it!\n6061 T6 Aluminium, tapered head tube, internal downtube battery and Built in Grid mounting plate\nBafang 750W drive unit\n48v, 13.2AH internal downtube battery, UL certified\n40 Mile plus range\nDual piston hydraulic disc brake with 180mm rotors\nMX Style front headlight and rear brake alert light\nLeft side thumb throttle\nAlloy 6-spoke mag wheels with 20 x 4\" Kenda tires\nEbike classification: Class 2, 750W/20MPH",
